[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0010","text":"──啊！\n对了，制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0020","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0030","text":"看好咯～……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0040","text":"……………────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0050","text":"！刚才那个眼神，非常好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0060","text":"练到位了吧～眼神力度！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0070","text":"你一直在镜子前面练嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0080","text":"诶～！\n练习的事被发现了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0090","text":"哈哈，原来是想保密吗？\n不过看起来可不像是在偷偷练哦……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900300_02_0100","text":"啊哈哈，那倒也是～\n下次的演唱会要注重眼神！我会留意的，要看着哦～！"}]
